ery and detective fans, but to absolutely everyone who wants an adorable and relaxing \u2013 but still challenging \u2013 set of varied puzzles to solve!\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 GameLuster<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/6274a77541cda5d1db0092a2081e55a378faeb30/ss_6274a77541cda5d1db0092a2081e55a378faeb30.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759486467","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/6274a77541cda5d1db0092a2081e55a378faeb30/ss_6274a77541cda5d1db0092a2081e55a378faeb30.600x338.jpg?t=1759486467"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/1ca0e50a0262679b0844bdc530b35e6cb016c5dc/ss_1ca0e50a0262679b0844bdc530b35e6cb016c5dc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759486467","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/1ca0e50a0262679b0844bdc530b35e6cb016c5dc/ss_1ca0e50a0262679b0844bdc530b35e6cb016c5dc.600x338.jpg?t=1759486467"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/ss_d46d0c42a563ef8e70db4fe68f908d303dd75dc2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759486467","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/ss_d46d0c42a563ef8e70db4fe68f908d303dd75dc2.600x338.jpg?t=1759486467"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/4806be677053cf2fb070bc842fc3659e1b7098c0/ss_4806be677053cf2fb070bc842fc3659e1b7098c0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759486467","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/4806be677053cf2fb070bc842fc3659e1b7098c0/ss_4806be677053cf2fb070bc842fc3659e1b7098c0.600x338.jpg?t=1759486467"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653470/ss_d9fa64622e3ab34277864aeaf1bf0c328d327be8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759486467","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic